    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Operational national food security response system 
Progress/Status: The Sub-decree for establishment of Cambodia Food Reserve System (CFRS) approved by the Prime Minister on 12 September 2012;

The Decision for the appointment of CFRS Committee members was approved by the Prime Minister on 14 February 2013; 

The Prakas for establishment of the CFRS Secretariat was approved by the Deputy Prime Minister on 19 June 2013;

The Prakas for appointment of the members of the CFRS Secretariat was approved by the Deputy Prime Minister on 19 June 2013;

The CFRS committee held their first meeting on 16 May 2013.

The Technical committee held their meeting on 23 March 2015 to discuss the draft final SOP. 

Draft Final SOP is discussed and updated, approved, printed and published. 
Data Source: Consulting Firm&amp;apos;s final report
Quarterly Progress Reports 
